 ("Do I need to register anywhere to import one item from China?", "No. For one personal item the courier or service files the declaration. You usually give only your CNIC and address."),
 ("How do I know if an item is allowed into Pakistan?", "Check the Import Policy Order lists and the regulator for your product. Drones, medicines, phones, counterfeit goods and loose batteries are the common problem areas."),
